<title>USA: GOLF-SECOND ROUND SCORES FROM THE WESTERN OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SECOND ROUND SCORES FROM THE WESTERN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>LEMONT, Illinois 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>Friday's second round of the $2 million Western Open played on</p>
<p>the 7,073-yard, par-72 Cog Hill course (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>135 Justin Leonard 71 64</p>
<p>137 Michael Bradley 69 68, Mike Hulbert 69 68, Billy Andrade</p>
<p>70 67</p>
<p>138 Jeff Sluman 69 69, Jay Delsing 71 67</p>
<p>139 Ted Tryba 71 68, Tommy Armour 69 70, Scott Hoch 71 68,</p>
<p>Tiger Woods 67 72, Mark O'Meara 66 73, Brent Geiberger 70 69</p>
<p>140 Larry Mize 70 70, Mike Springer 70 70, Davis Love 72 68,</p>
<p>John Cook 73 67, Rafael Alarcon (Mexico) 69 71</p>
<p>141 Loren Roberts 70 71, Phil Blackmar 67 74, Bob Tway 73 68,</p>
<p>Frank Nobilo (New Zealand) 71 70, Scott Simpson 74 67, Steve</p>
<p>Hart 71 70, Jimmy Johnston 73 68, David Duval 68 73, Jim Furyk</p>
<p>67 74, Andrew Magee 69 72, Russ Cochran 70 71</p>
